# Gravewell Shaft (CIPlay gravewell_shaft): 45 m down; the rim, the permit, the cage elevator to the pit floor, gallery 1
# (anglers, the logbook), gallery 2 (the pump key), the pump hall, the smelter store's three plans, Halvard's log 7.
island Gravewell Shaft
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Gravewell
zone rim
expect step 1
read Shaft entry permit
expect step 2
use cage
expect story cagedown 1
expect step 3
air gallery_1
expect step 4
zone shaft
kill Angler fish
expect step 5
read Gallery logbook
expect step 6
air gallery_2
open Gallery crate
wait 3
expect story pumpkey 1
expect step 7
open Pump hall
wait 3
expect step 8
open Smelter store
wait 3
expect step 11
read Halvard's log 7
expect done
